var e=JSON.parse(`[{"id":"2.1","title":"Kaeda","capitulo":"The Contact","text":["The address dumps you in a corridor behind a closed market. Flickering light, burnt-wire stink, a steel door with no handle.","Leaning against the wall, smoking a data cigarette that blows pixel smoke, there she is. The same one from the hood.","[KAEDA] \\"Took you long enough.\\"","She takes off her shades. Young face. The eyes aren't. They've buried people and stopped counting.","[KAEDA] \\"Name's Kaeda. And I needed to talk to you before they do.\\"","She drops the cigarette to the ground. It dissolves before it hits.","[KAEDA] \\"You're no ordinary player. You felt it when you fell. Felt it in the Encruzilhada.\\"","She knows about the Encruzilhada. Nobody should know about the Encruzilhada.","[KAEDA] \\"You're an Echo.\\"","The word hits you like a bell in an empty church. And it echoes on, which is exactly what she wanted to happen."],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"\\"What the fuck is an Echo?\\"","flags_set":["PERGUNTOU_ECO"],"next_scene":"2.1a"},{"id":"B","label":"\\"How do you know that?\\"","flags_set":["PERGUNTOU_SABE"],"next_scene":"2.1b"},{"id":"C","label":"Get in her face before she gets in yours","requer":{"hab":21},"flags_set":["DESCONFIOU_KAEDA"],"next_scene":"2.1c"}]},{"id":"2.1a","title":"Echo","text":["[KAEDA] \\"LDI wasn't built from nothing. It was built on top of something. Something old, that used to think.\\"","She looks up at the ceiling, like she can see right through it.","[KAEDA] \\"When that thing died, pieces were left behind. Fragments stuck in the code, like bones at a construction site.\\"","[KAEDA] \\"Every now and then one of those pieces latches onto a player. And the player turns into something else. Turns into an Echo.\\"","She points at your chest with two fingers. The same two fingers that touched you in the ring.","[KAEDA] \\"And Yohualticit wipes Echoes. No warning, no noise. One day the guy's here, the next his account never existed.\\"","[KAEDA] \\"They're already looking for you.\\"","{veia:5} The static in your head stops. For the first time since the fall, total silence. Like the thing on the other side hid to listen."],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"Let her finish","next_scene":"2.1d"}]},{"id":"2.1b","title":"The Mark","text":["[KAEDA] \\"Because I've seen one before. And the system's tagging you like cattle.\\"","She pulls a holo from her pocket and tosses it in the air between you. It's you. Your avatar, spinning slowly. Only it's outlined in red, like a mugshot in the paper.","Underneath, a tag: ECO UNCLASSIFIED.","[KAEDA] \\"That tag only shows up on someone the system already tried to delete once.\\"","{veia:1} You read the tag code over her shoulder. It's not an error tag. It's a work order. It has a date. And the date is tomorrow.","{veia:3} The hologram has a timestamp in the corner. It was generated four minutes ago. Someone's looking at you right now.","[KAEDA] \\"They can track that tag. We need to get out of here.\\""],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"Go with her","next_scene":"2.1d"}]},{"id":"2.1c","title":"Reflex","text":["You don't think. Your body thinks for you.","Before she even finishes the sentence, you already got your forearm on her neck, her back against the steel door.","She doesn't even blink.","[KAEDA] \\"Interesting.\\"","She looks at your arm. Then at your face. No fear. Something that looks like approval.","[KAEDA] \\"Real reflex. Nobody taught you that. That's Canvas.\\"","[KAEDA] \\"Now listen: if I wanted you out cold, you'd have been out cold since the square. Take your arm off.\\"","There's something in her voice that makes you obey. It's not fear. It's more annoying than fear. It's that she's right.","[KAEDA] \\"Good. Now come on. We don't have much time.\\""],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"Take your arm off and go with her","next_scene":"2.1d"}]},{"id":"2.1d","title":"The Hideout","text":["The handleless door opens when she presses her palm to it.","It's small inside. A terminal, two mismatched chairs, a mattress in the corner, and the walls completely covered in an LDI map, red lines connecting point to point, like a detective's room in an old movie.","[KAEDA] \\"Not much. But the system can't see in here.\\"","She sits. Holds out her hand.","[KAEDA] \\"Give me your display.\\"","---","I'll tell you a rule that holds in here and out there: whoever asks for your phone wants to know who you are. Whoever asks for your display wants to decide who you're going to be.","[KAEDA] \\"I'm gonna give you everything I got. The StormBytes, Zona Leste, whoever's behind the fall that landed you here.\\"","[KAEDA] \\"You're gonna need all of it. Either you take it, or you go back to the square and wait for them to find you.\\"","{veia:4} She ain't offering. She's recruiting. That's different. Someone offering hands you a thing. Someone recruiting asks for your life and calls it a gift."],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"Hand over the display","flags_set":["CONFIOU_KAEDA","RECRUTADO"],"next_scene":"2.2"},{"id":"B","label":"\\"Data given is data traced. No.\\"","flags_set":["RECUSOU_DADOS_KAEDA"],"next_scene":"2.2b"}]},{"id":"2.2","title":"The Organization","text":["The transfer takes eleven seconds. You feel every single one on the back of your neck.","When it's done, the terminal lights up with stuff you've never seen. Internal logs. Rank spreadsheet. Photos of people who don't exist anymore.","[KAEDA] \\"There's a crew in here. We call ourselves the Organization 'cause a flashy name gets eyes.\\"","[KAEDA] \\"Yohualticit hides stuff. Everybody knows that. What few people know is there are people inside selling what they find. Fight results. Player data. Sometimes the player themselves.\\"","She spins her chair your way.","[KAEDA] \\"We want to know who. And we want to stop it.\\"","Silence. The terminal hums.","[KAEDA] \\"You in?\\""],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"\\"I'm in.\\"","flags_required":["CONFIOU_KAEDA"],"flags_set":["ACEITOU_ORGANIZACAO"],"decisao":true,"next_scene":"2.3"},{"id":"B","label":"\\"Give me a day.\\"","flags_set":["PENSOU_ORGANIZACAO"],"next_scene":"2.2b"},{"id":"C","label":"\\"This ain't my fight.\\"","flags_set":["RECUSOU_ORGANIZACAO"],"decisao":true,"next_scene":"2.4fim"}]},{"id":"2.2b","title":"One Day","text":["Kaeda doesn't push it. Just shakes her head, slow.","[KAEDA] \\"Fair. But the system doesn't wait for anyone to think.\\"","She tosses you a token. Small, cold, heavier than it should be.","[KAEDA] \\"You change your mind, this token brings you to me. You don't, toss it. Just don't let anyone catch you with it.\\"","---","You spend the rest of the day walking with no destination.","Thinking about Eco, about the red tag, about people who vanish from the system like they never existed. Thinking about your three-by-three room and your body lying there, alone, waiting for you to come back.","The next day, the token heats up in your pocket.","It's her. Asking without asking."],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"\\"I'm in.\\"","flags_set":["ACEITOU_ORGANIZACAO","RECRUTADO"],"decisao":true,"next_scene":"2.3"},{"id":"B","label":"Toss the token","flags_set":["RECUSOU_ORGANIZACAO"],"decisao":true,"next_scene":"2.4fim"}]},{"id":"2.3","title":"Anomalous Code","destaque":true,"text":["Kaeda smiles. First time. Looks weird on her face, like borrowed clothes.","[KAEDA] \\"Good choice.\\"","She shakes your hand. Firm, dry grip, like someone closing a deal.","[KAEDA] \\"From now on you're part of something bigger than the LDI. That's good and bad. You'll find out both.\\"","The terminal blinks. Outside, in the room, your SBI heats up against the back of your neck.","[SISTEMA] \\"ANOMALOUS CODE ACTIVE.\\"","Something shifted in the air. Can't see it. Can feel it, like pressure before rain.","{veia:1} You feel the mod entering your SBI. It's beautiful code. Too beautiful to have been made in a room like this.","{veia:5} The static returns. Closer. And now you're almost sure: it likes Kaeda."],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"See what changed","flags_set":["ATO2_COMPLETO"],"next_scene":"2.fim"}]},{"id":"2.4fim","title":"Out","text":["You refuse.","And it's all good. I swear it is. Not every story needs you in it.","Kaeda doesn't argue. Just opens the door and waits for you to go through.","[KAEDA] \\"Good luck, Eco. You're gonna need it.\\"","---","On the way back, a notification on your SBI.","[SISTEMA] \\"WE KNOW WHAT YOU ARE.\\"","No sender. You delete it.","It comes back.","You delete it again. It comes back again.","Next day, your SBI just won't turn on. Four months of savings dead on the bed.","When you finally get it to light up a week later, there's one different thing on the home screen. A little red dot in the corner. A camera.","Someone's watching.","Sometimes not going in is a choice, too. The bill still comes anyway."],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"Turn off the SBI","flags_set":["FIM_FORK_RECUSA"],"next_scene":"fim:fork"}]},{"id":"2.fim","title":"Cover","text":["The days change color.","You keep fighting, keep climbing the ranks, keep taking hits. Except now every fight is something else. Every fight is cover.","While two thousand spectators watch the ring, your SBI pulls files from the system under the table. You hit, you get hit, and the Organization reads.","---","And slowly, a picture starts to form.","Someone inside Yohualticit is siphoning player data. Someone with inside access. Someone who knows exactly where nobody looks.","One night, Kaeda shows up at your cube without knocking. A digital folder in one hand, the face of someone who hasn't slept in days.","[KAEDA] \\"Time to find out who it is.\\""],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"Open the folder","flags_set":["FIM_ATO2"],"next_scene":"3.1"}]}]`);export{e as default};
//# sourceMappingURL=act2-trsSPq6m.js.map